/target
Cargo.lock.orig
*.pcap
*.pcapng
docs/specs/
docs/plans/
/dist

# Screenshots of the reference meter used to drive UI work (issue #9). They are
# captures of another project's UI, so they stay local rather than being
# redistributed here.
docs/reference/

# The name cache `main.rs` falls back to when there is no %APPDATA% — i.e. any
# time the overlay is run on a dev box rather than on Windows.
/ShinraMeter-BPSR-names.json

# The scene -> final-boss cache `main.rs` falls back to when there is no
# %APPDATA% (issue #131) — i.e. any time the overlay is run on a dev box
# rather than on Windows.
/ShinraMeter-BPSR-scene-bosses.json

# The single-instance lock `single_instance.rs` falls back to when there is no
# %APPDATA% (issue #277) — i.e. any time the overlay is run on a dev box
# rather than on Windows.
/ShinraMeter-BPSR-instance.lock

# The log file `logging.rs` falls back to when there is no %APPDATA% (issue
# #69), plus its startup-rotation copy.
/ShinraMeter-BPSR.log
/ShinraMeter-BPSR.log.1

# Packet-inspection diagnostic dumps (issue #25, opt-in since issue #122 —
# set SHINRA_INSPECT=1 to enable). These contain player names and
# other identifying traffic captured from a live session — never commit one
# or attach it to an issue/PR; mint a minimal synthetic fixture instead.
ShinraMeter-BPSR-inspect-dump-*.jsonl
inspect-dumps/
*.inspect-dump.jsonl

# Byte-compiled Python, created when `scripts/prep-skill-icons.py` imports
# `scripts/prep-imagine-icons.py` to reuse its transforms.
__pycache__/

# token-savior MCP's local code index. Regenerated on demand, several MB, and
# specific to one checkout path — never useful to commit.
/.token-savior-cache.json
